    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "python_api_process", "x": 100, "y": 480, "width": 420, "height": 230,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20012,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20112, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["topology_group"],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "python_api_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arrow_http_python", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_python_input", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_python_output", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_tensor_ipc", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_coord_front", "type": "arrow"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "python_api_text", "x": 145, "y": 510, "width": 330, "height": 171,
      "text": "Process A / N · Python API Server\n\nFastAPI + OpenAIServing + AsyncLLM\nAsyncMPClient / DP*Client\n\nROUTER input socket    (bind)\nPULL output socket     (bind)\nMsgpackEncoder / Decoder\n\nclient_index routes outputs here", "originalText": "Process A / N · Python API Server\n\nFastAPI + OpenAIServing + AsyncLLM\nAsyncMPClient / DP*Client\n\nROUTER input socket    (bind)\nPULL output socket     (bind)\nMsgpackEncoder / Decoder\n\nclient_index routes outputs here",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20013,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20113, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["topology_group"],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "python_api_process", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "rust_frontend_process", "x": 100, "y": 800, "width": 420, "height": 230,
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20014,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20114, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["topology_group"],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "rust_frontend_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arrow_http_rust", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_rust_input", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow_rust_output", "type": "arrow"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "rust_frontend_text", "x": 145, "y": 830, "width": 330, "height": 171,
      "text": "Process R · Rust frontend（实验）\n\nAxum / tonic + renderer/parser\nRust EngineCoreClient\n\nRouterSendHalf          (bind)\nPullSocket              (bind)\nserde tuple + MessagePack\n\n替换 frontend，不替换 Python core", "originalText": "Process R · Rust frontend（实验）\n\nAxum / tonic + renderer/parser\nRust EngineCoreClient\n\nRouterSendHalf          (bind)\nPullSocket              (bind)\nserde tuple + MessagePack\n\n替换 frontend，不替换 Python core",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20015,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20115, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["topology_group"],
