    {
      "type": "text", "id": "dp_coordinator_text", "x": 1572, "y": 402, "width": 306, "height": 235,
      "text": "Process C · DPCoordinatorProc\n(online DP only)\n\nPULL output_back\n← scheduler [waiting, running] + wave\n\nXPUB publish_back\n→ core START_DP_WAVE / running state\n\nXPUB publish_front\n→ frontend load snapshots\n\n控制面，不传 model tensor", "originalText": "Process C · DPCoordinatorProc\n(online DP only)\n\nPULL output_back\n← scheduler [waiting, running] + wave\n\nXPUB publish_back\n→ core START_DP_WAVE / running state\n\nXPUB publish_front\n→ frontend load snapshots\n\n控制面，不传 model tensor",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20032,
