    {
      "type": "text", "id": "rank_key_note", "x": 570, "y": 1020, "width": 850, "height": 75,
      "text": "不要合并三个 routing key\nclient_index = 输出回哪个 frontend  ·  engine_index / DP rank = 哪个 core 调度  ·  Worker/global rank = 模型并行 rank\n同为 0-based，也不代表同一命名空间", "originalText": "不要合并三个 routing key\nclient_index = 输出回哪个 frontend  ·  engine_index / DP rank = 哪个 core 调度  ·  Worker/global rank = 模型并行 rank\n同为 0-based，也不代表同一命名空间",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20052,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20152, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["topology_group"], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "protocol_title", "x": 72, "y": 1190, "width": 1200, "height": 32,
      "text": "Level 2 · 三种传输的 wire/security 语义不同", "originalText": "Level 2 · 三种传输的 wire/security 语义不同",
      "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
