    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "msgpack_evidence", "x": 70, "y": 1250, "width": 760, "height": 380,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30010,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30110, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["protocol_group"],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "msgpack_evidence_text", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "msgpack_evidence_text", "x": 105, "y": 1277, "width": 690, "height": 328,
      "text": "Frontend ↔ EngineCore · explicit cross-language schema\n\nINPUT multipart\nROUTER: [engine_identity][type_byte][msgpack_root][aux_0]...\nDEALER:                  [type_byte][msgpack_root][aux_0]...\n\n0x00 ADD       → EngineCoreRequest\n0x01 ABORT     → request_id[]\n0x02 START_DP_WAVE\n0x03 UTILITY   → (client_index, call_id, method, args)\n0x04 EXECUTOR_FAILED  · Python internal\n0x05 WAKEUP           · Python internal\n\nOUTPUT multipart\n[msgpack EngineCoreOutputs][aux_0]...\n\nmsgspec array-like field order = Python/Rust compatibility contract\nVLLM_ALLOW_INSECURE_SERIALIZATION=1 才允许 pickle fallback", "originalText": "Frontend ↔ EngineCore · explicit cross-language schema\n\nINPUT multipart\nROUTER: [engine_identity][type_byte][msgpack_root][aux_0]...\nDEALER:                  [type_byte][msgpack_root][aux_0]...\n\n0x00 ADD       → EngineCoreRequest\n0x01 ABORT     → request_id[]\n0x02 START_DP_WAVE\n0x03 UTILITY   → (client_index, call_id, method, args)\n0x04 EXECUTOR_FAILED  · Python internal\n0x05 WAKEUP           · Python internal\n\nOUTPUT multipart\n[msgpack EngineCoreOutputs][aux_0]...\n\nmsgspec array-like field order = Python/Rust compatibility contract\nVLLM_ALLOW_INSECURE_SERIALIZATION=1 才允许 pickle fallback",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30011,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30111, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["protocol_group"],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "msgpack_evidence", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "message_queue_evidence", "x": 860, "y": 1250, "width": 670, "height": 380,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30012,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30112, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["protocol_group"],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "message_queue_evidence_text", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "message_queue_evidence_text", "x": 900, "y": 1280, "width": 590, "height": 320,
      "text": "EngineCore / Executor ↔ Worker · trusted Python object control\n\ncollective_rpc payload\n(method, args, kwargs, output_rank)\n\nserialization\npickle protocol 5 + out-of-band PickleBuffer\n\nlocal readers\nshared-memory ring buffer\nlarge/overflow payload → IPC XPUB/SUB multipart\n\nremote readers\nTCP XPUB/SUB\n\nresponse queues return status / ModelRunnerOutput / FAILURE\n\n它不是 external broker，也不是 Frontend/Core MessagePack wire", "originalText": "EngineCore / Executor ↔ Worker · trusted Python object control\n\ncollective_rpc payload\n(method, args, kwargs, output_rank)\n\nserialization\npickle protocol 5 + out-of-band PickleBuffer\n\nlocal readers\nshared-memory ring buffer\nlarge/overflow payload → IPC XPUB/SUB multipart\n\nremote readers\nTCP XPUB/SUB\n\nresponse queues return status / ModelRunnerOutput / FAILURE\n\n它不是 external broker，也不是 Frontend/Core MessagePack wire",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30013,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30113, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["protocol_group"],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "message_queue_evidence", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "data_plane_evidence", "x": 1560, "y": 1250, "width": 770, "height": 380,
