    {
      "type": "text", "id": "data_plane_evidence_text", "x": 1605, "y": 1280, "width": 680, "height": 320,
      "text": "Worker rank ↔ Worker rank · model tensor data plane\n\ninit_distributed_environment()\n→ torch.distributed.init_process_group(backend, rank, world_size)\n\ninitialize_model_parallel()\nExternalDP × DP × PP × PCP × TP + EP / DCP groups\n\nTP  all-reduce / all-gather / reduce-scatter activation\nPP  isend/irecv IntermediateTensors between stages\nDP  replica/MoE state collective（≠ DPCoordinator load stats）\nEP  token/expert all-to-all dispatch + combine\nPCP/DCP  context shard gather/all-to-all\n\nbackends: NCCL · Gloo · XCCL · platform communicator\n\nKV / EC connectors have their own tensor transport\n这些数据不经过 Frontend MessagePack 或 Executor control MQ", "originalText": "Worker rank ↔ Worker rank · model tensor data plane\n\ninit_distributed_environment()\n→ torch.distributed.init_process_group(backend, rank, world_size)\n\ninitialize_model_parallel()\nExternalDP × DP × PP × PCP × TP + EP / DCP groups\n\nTP  all-reduce / all-gather / reduce-scatter activation\nPP  isend/irecv IntermediateTensors between stages\nDP  replica/MoE state collective（≠ DPCoordinator load stats）\nEP  token/expert all-to-all dispatch + combine\nPCP/DCP  context shard gather/all-to-all\n\nbackends: NCCL · Gloo · XCCL · platform communicator\n\nKV / EC connectors have their own tensor transport\n这些数据不经过 Frontend MessagePack 或 Executor control MQ",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30015,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30115, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": ["protocol_group"],
      "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "data_plane_evidence", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "protocol_contrast_note", "x": 72, "y": 1650, "width": 2200, "height": 50,
      "text": "同样出现 ZMQ，并不等于同一协议：MessagePack schema 面向 Python/Rust frontend 兼容；MessageQueue 面向受控 Python Worker 拓扑；torch.distributed 面向 tensor collective。", "originalText": "同样出现 ZMQ，并不等于同一协议：MessagePack schema 面向 Python/Rust frontend 兼容；MessageQueue 面向受控 Python Worker 拓扑；torch.distributed 面向 tensor collective。",
      "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30016,
